    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0145" n="879" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg879"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received May 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 107.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my No. 105, of the 2d instant, I
                    informed you of the receipt of your No. 65, of February 21 last, in regard to
                    Mr. Thurston, late Hawaiian minister at Washington, and the communication of its
                    contents to this Government.</p>
                <p>I have the honor now to inclose herewith copy of a note from this <pb facs="0146"
                        n="880" xml:id="pg880"/> Government, dated the 3d instant and received
                    to-day, the substance of which was sent you by telegram of this date.</p>
                <p>I also inclose copy of my note of acknowledgment.</p>
                <p>With assurances, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert S. Willis.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d88-a1.xml" xpointer="d88-a1"/>
